---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="常见问题" titleEn="FAQ">
  <section class="container public-inner-hero faq-hero" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
    <div class="public-hero-copy">
      <div class="public-kicker"><span class="public-kicker-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-zh="答疑中心">HELP CENTER</span></div>
      <h1 id="faq-heading" data-zh="你可能想知道这些。">What you may want to know.</h1>
      <p class="lead" data-zh="从第一条 AI 回复，到额度、付款与账户连接，在这里找到答案。">From your first AI reply to credits, billing and connecting your account.</p>
      <p class="lead public-cms-faq" data-site-text="faq" style="white-space:pre-wrap" hidden></p>
      <div class="guide-actions"><a href="/guide" class="button secondary"><span data-zh="查看使用指南">Browse the guide</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <aside class="public-hero-visual faq-hero-visual" aria-label="Help center illustration">
      <div class="mini-panel-head"><img src="/favicon.svg" width="30" height="30" alt="" /><div><strong>x-Reply-Helper</strong><span data-zh="帮助与支持">Help & support</span></div><span class="mini-panel-pro">FAQ</span></div>
      <div class="faq-illustration-mark" aria-hidden="true">?</div>
      <p data-zh="你的问题，我们认真回答。">Answers that make your next step easier.</p>
    </aside>
  </section>
  <section class="container public-content-section faq-section" aria-labelledby="faq-section-title">
    <div class="public-section-header"><div><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="常见疑问">MOST ASKED</div><h2 id="faq-section-title" data-zh="问题与答案">Questions & answers</h2></div><p data-zh="点击问题展开或收起答案。">Select a question to expand or collapse the answer.</p></div>
    <div data-site-faq-default class="public-faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item public-faq-item" open>
        <summary><span class="faq-number">01</span><h3 data-zh="免费额度何时领取？">When do I receive free credits?</h3><span class="faq-expand" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p data-zh="验证邮箱并首次在插件中连接账户后，200 次新人免费额度会发放到账户。额度不按天或月重置，也不主动过期。">After verifying your email and connecting your account in the extension for the first time, 200 welcome credits are added to your account. Credits do not reset daily or monthly and do not have a scheduled expiry.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item public-faq-item">
        <summary><span class="faq-number">02</span><h3 data-zh="一次生成三种风格扣几次？">How many credits do three styles use?</h3><span class="faq-expand" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p data-zh="一次请求生成自然、幽默、观点三种候选，只扣一次。切换、复制或填入草稿不会再扣。">One request returns natural, playful, and thoughtful drafts and uses one credit. Switching, copying, or filling a draft costs no extra credits.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item public-faq-item">
        <summary><span class="faq-number">03</span><h3 data-zh="会自动发送 X 回复吗？">Will it post on X?</h3><span class="faq-expand" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p data-zh="不会。你检查草稿后决定是否点击发送。">No. You review the draft and decide whether to send it.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item public-faq-item">
        <summary><span class="faq-number">04</span><h3 data-zh="没有出现悬浮窗？">Why isn't the floating reply panel showing?</h3><span class="faq-expand" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p data-zh="请刷新 X 官网（x.com）页面。不要使用 Google 网页翻译；如果已开启，请先关闭翻译、恢复原文，再刷新页面。">Refresh X (x.com). Do not use Google Translate's webpage translation. If translation is enabled, turn it off, restore the original page, and refresh.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
    <div class="public-faq-contact"><div><h3 data-zh="还有其他问题？">Need more help?</h3><p data-zh="也可以直接给我们发送反馈。">Send us feedback about anything else.</p></div><a href="/feedback" class="button secondary"><span data-zh="联系支持">Contact support</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </section>
</Base>